Project: Employee Workforce Analysis in Excel

Give students a 1,000–2,000 employee dataset containing deliberate quality problems.

Students perform cleaning, duplicate detection, missing-value treatment, employee segmentation, XLOOKUP, IF/IFS, SUMIFS/COUNTIFS, date calculations, PivotTables, PivotCharts, conditional formatting and basic statistical analysis.

Business question: “What are the major workforce issues management should address?”

Deliverable: Cleaned dataset + interactive Excel HR dashboard.
